window.bookSummaryJSON = "<p>Don’t believe in magic? Boy are you in for a shock.</p> <p></p> <p>Convicted of a double homicide, the famous Wizard of Aus proves no cell can hold him, but his seemingly impossible prison break is more than a bid for freedom – he’s got his sights set on vengeance – against the whole city.</p> <p></p> <p>Darius Kane thinks it’s a job for the police and he’s got his own work cut out trying to track down a secret underworld character more elusive than smoke. Known only as the Djinn, Darius must stop her if he wants to keep living.</p> <p></p> <p>However, when the wizard proves he can kill and vanish before the police can even react, can he really ignore the pleas for his involvement? Maybe, but when a new client enters the fray who might hold the key to identifying Darius’s nemesis, there really is no choice but to take the case.</p> <p></p> <p>Alongside renowned English sleuth, Patricia Fisher, and her team, Darius must fight to find the connection between the wizard, the Djinn, and a criminal overlord and he’d better do it fast as the clock is ticking and the city is set to explode.</p>"; 
